{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally and Vanessa Visit the Grand Canyon", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Camping in the Canyon", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Nature Around Us > Greetings From Alaska", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Describes vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<span class =\"strong\"> Suggestions in Advertising</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you read an advertisement, you see phrases that make suggestions. They can influence your decision.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Why not see one of the Seven Natural Wonders of the World?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">What it Says in the Ad</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Come to the Grand Canyon to get away from the stress of everyday life. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's an appealing invitation.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sleep in the open air.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's a unique experience.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Climb with us to see a panorama.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> It's an invitation to excitement. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why not follow the Bright Angel Trail?  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There are no negative reasons. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hiking boots are important.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You shouldn't use other shoes. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">A fleece jacket is a must. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You could be cold if you don't bring one.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">A water bottle is essential. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You can't survive without it.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Sunscreen lotion is essential.</span>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "essential", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very much needed  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Water is essential when we go for a long hike.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear when you prepare for a hiking trip.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "angel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a heavenly being ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When I was tired, I felt like an angel helped me up the mountain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "everyday", "type": "name"}, {"content": "ordinary; typical; usual", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sitting on a crowded bus is an everyday routine for me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "the wild", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the outdoors in its natural form ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Camping in the wild is quite different from camping at the beach.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "important", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes something with great value ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's very important to have a cell phone when you go out of the city.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "campground", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small area used for camping ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: After we arrived at the campground, we put up our tent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le14ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Find an ad in the newspaper or on a website for a trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find what the ad says you can do on this trip. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Chat with your friends about what you can do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5 to 7 sentences about the items you need to bring on this trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your friends to write another list. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Decide together what you should bring.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I locate information on an advertisement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express and receive suggestions using the target words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 5 to 7 sentences about items necessary for a trip.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn4le14ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le14ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "1", "id": 1, "text": "Looking for excitement in your life? Camp with us in the Grand Canyon!</br></br>Come to the Grand Canyon to get away from the stress of everyday life.</br>Sleep in the open air to have stories to tell of the